              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "lede",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "When you're investing in a dry van trailer, the manufacturer matters, but the dealer you choose matters just as much. Working with experienced Hyundai dry van trailer dealers like Sun State Trailers ensures you're not just getting a trailer; you're getting the right trailer for your business, backed by people who understand what's on the line. For owner-operators and fleet managers, that difference shows up in uptime, cost savings, and peace of mind.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full",
                    "anchor": "post-lede"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-stands-apart",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "What Sets Hyundai Trailers Apart",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "stands-apart"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-stands-apart-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "There's a reason Hyundai trailers have become a trusted name in the industry. Built with durability, efficiency, and performance in mind, they're designed to handle the daily demands of freight transport without cutting corners. Here's what makes a Hyundai semi-trailer stand out:",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "features-stands-apart-2",
                  "type": "list",
                  "props": {
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "columns": 3,
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "label": "Built for Long-Term Durability",
                        "desc": "Hyundai trailers are engineered with high-quality materials that resist wear and tear. That means fewer repairs, longer lifespans, and better resale value."
                      },
                      {
                        "label": "Lightweight Without Sacrificing Strength",
                        "desc": "A lighter trailer means more payload capacity. For businesses focused on maximizing each haul, that efficiency directly impacts profitability."
                      },
                      {
                        "label": "Consistent Performance Across Fleets",
                        "desc": "Whether you're running one truck or managing a fleet, consistency matters. Hyundai trailers are known for reliability, which helps reduce unexpected downtime."
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "fig-1",
                  "type": "image",
                  "props": {
                    "width": "full",
                    "image": {
                      "src": "/img/blog/why-choose-hyundai-dry-van-trailer-dealers/1.jpg",
                      "width": 1000,
                      "height": 667,
                      "alt": "Row of Hyundai Translead trailer wheels and mudflaps at Sun State Trailers"
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-dealer-difference",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Why the Right Hyundai Dry Van Trailer Dealer Makes a Difference",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "dealer-difference"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-dealer-difference-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Not all dealers operate the same way. And if you've been in this industry long enough, you've probably felt that firsthand. Here's what separates a dependable dealer from the rest:",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h3-dealer-difference-2",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "1. Straightforward Guidance",
                    "headingLevel": 3,
                    "align": "left"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-dealer-difference-3",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "You don't need a sales pitch. You need clear answers about specs, pricing, and availability. The right dealer respects your time and gives you exactly what you need to make a decision.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h3-dealer-difference-4",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "2. Inventory That Fits Your Business",
                    "headingLevel": 3,
                    "align": "left"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-dealer-difference-5",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Whether you're searching for a Hyundai trailer for sale or comparing different dry van trailer options, having access to the right inventory matters. A good dealer doesn't push what's available; they help you find what works.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h3-dealer-difference-6",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "3. Support Beyond the Sale",
                    "headingLevel": 3,
                    "align": "left"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-dealer-difference-7",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "A trailer is an investment, not a one-time transaction. The best Hyundai dry van trailer dealers build relationships, offering support, service, and parts long after the purchase.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
